{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 89,
  "number": "0089",
  "title": "Daily Life - At The Airport",
  "audio": "mp3/89. Daily Life - At The Airport.mp3",
  "duration": 812.826125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 1.94,
      "end": 3.0,
      "en": "Hello English learners.",
      "zh": "各位英语学习者，大家好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 3.36,
      "end": 4.64,
      "en": "Welcome back to EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "欢迎回到 EnglishPod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 4.64,
      "end": 5.16,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 5.5,
      "end": 6.3,
      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 6.98,
      "end": 8.96,
      "en": "And today we're going to be taking you to the airport.",
      "zh": "今天我们要带你去机场。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 9.56,
      "end": 9.92,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 10.26,
      "end": 16.06,
      "en": "We're going to listen as a man checks in at the airport and deals with his luggage.",
      "zh": "我们要听一个人在机场办理登机手续并处理他的行李。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 16.8,
      "end": 17.26,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 18.12,
      "end": 23.2,
      "en": "So we're going to be looking at a lot of great stuff that can help you the next time you are at the airport at the check-in counter.",
      "zh": "所以我们将看到很多很棒的东西，可以在您下次在机场值机柜台时为您提供帮助。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 24.04,
      "end": 28.76,
      "en": "So why don't we take a look at one word that we're going to preview today in Vocabulary Preview.",
      "zh": "那么我们为什么不看看我们今天将在词汇预览中预览的一个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 30.1,
      "end": 30.9,
      "en": "Vocabulary Preview.",
      "zh": "词汇预习。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 32.54,
      "end": 35.65,
      "en": "We're going to hear this guy say, I'd like to check three pieces.",
      "zh": "我们要听这家伙说，我想检查三块。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 36.48,
      "end": 39.8,
      "en": "He's going to check three pieces of what?",
      "zh": "他要检查三块什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 39.8,
      "end": 40.77,
      "en": "Pieces of luggage.",
      "zh": "行李件。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 41.66,
      "end": 45.01,
      "en": "So when we talk about luggage, we can say pieces of luggage.",
      "zh": "所以当我们谈论行李时，我们可以说行李块。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 45.56,
      "end": 46.56,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 46.56,
      "end": 48.49,
      "en": "Luggage is a non-count noun.",
      "zh": "行李是非计数名词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 48.94,
      "end": 52.18,
      "en": "So you can't say one luggage, two luggages, three luggages.",
      "zh": "所以你不能说一件行李，两件行李，三件行李。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 52.18,
      "end": 52.33,
      "en": "That's wrong.",
      "zh": "那不对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 52.67,
      "end": 52.87,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 53.04,
      "end": 56.0,
      "en": "So we use pieces of luggage.",
      "zh": "所以我们使用行李块。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 56.48,
      "end": 57.48,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 57.48,
      "end": 58.67,
      "en": "So three pieces of luggage.",
      "zh": "于是三件行李。"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 60.08,
      "end": 60.24,
      "en": "Very good.",
      "zh": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 61.08,
      "end": 62.64,
      "en": "Let's listen to our dialogue for the first time.",
      "zh": "让我们第一次听我们的对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 62.84,
      "end": 68.0,
      "en": "We're going to see what happens with this guy at the airport and with his pieces of luggage.",
      "zh": "我们将看看这个人在机场和他的行李中会发生什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 76.84,
      "end": 77.68,
      "en": "Next please.",
      "zh": "下一位，请。"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 78.49,
      "end": 79.33,
      "en": "Hello, sir.",
      "zh": "您好，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 79.55,
      "end": 80.69,
      "en": "May I see your passport, please?",
      "zh": "我可以看你的护照吗?"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 81.01,
      "end": 81.25,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 82.05,
      "end": 82.59,
      "en": "Here you go.",
      "zh": "给你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 83.01,
      "end": 84.71,
      "en": "Will you be checking any bags today?",
      "zh": "您今天有行李要托运吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 85.09,
      "end": 85.35,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 85.65,
      "end": 86.61,
      "en": "I'd like to check three pieces.",
      "zh": "我想托运三件。"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 87.34,
      "end": 88.38,
      "en": "I'm sorry, sir.",
      "zh": "对不起，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 89.12,
      "end": 95.48,
      "en": "Airline policy only allows two pieces of checked luggage at 20 kilograms each plus one piece of carry-on luggage.",
      "zh": "航空公司规定每人只能托运两件行李，每件不超过二十公斤，另可携带一件随身行李。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 96.16,
      "end": 98.24,
      "en": "I will have to charge you extra for the additional suitcase.",
      "zh": "第三件行李要额外收费。"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 98.8,
      "end": 99.8,
      "en": "What?",
      "zh": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 99.8,
      "end": 100.8,
      "en": "Why?",
      "zh": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 100.8,
      "end": 101.62,
      "en": "I'm taking an intercontinental flight.",
      "zh": "我坐的可是洲际航班。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 101.92,
      "end": 104.32,
      "en": "I'm flying 16,000 kilometers.",
      "zh": "我要飞行一万六千公里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 104.32,
      "end": 107.52,
      "en": "How am I supposed to take only two 20 kilo bags?",
      "zh": "只带两件二十公斤的行李怎么够？"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 107.52,
      "end": 108.52,
      "en": "That's absurd.",
      "zh": "太荒唐了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 108.52,
      "end": 109.51,
      "en": "I'm sorry, sir.",
      "zh": "对不起，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 109.73,
      "end": 110.51,
      "en": "There's nothing I can do.",
      "zh": "我也无能为力。"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 111.03,
      "end": 113.79,
      "en": "You cannot board the flight with that large bag either.",
      "zh": "那个大包也不能带上飞机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 114.4,
      "end": 118.4,
      "en": "Carry-on bags must fit in the overhead compartment or under your seat.",
      "zh": "随身行李必须放得进头顶行李舱或前排座椅下方。"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 118.4,
      "end": 120.13,
      "en": "That bag is clearly too big.",
      "zh": "那个包显然太大了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 120.76,
      "end": 121.07,
      "en": "Now I see.",
      "zh": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 121.76,
      "end": 123.47,
      "en": "You charge next to nothing for an international ticket.",
      "zh": "国际机票卖得几乎不赚钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 123.64,
      "end": 127.88,
      "en": "When it comes to charging for any other small thing, you charge an arm and a leg.",
      "zh": "其他一点小事却收费贵得离谱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 127.88,
      "end": 130.67,
      "en": "So tell me, miss, how much will I have to pay for all of this?",
      "zh": "小姐，你说吧，这些一共要付多少钱？"
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 131.67,
      "end": 132.49,
      "en": "Let's see.",
      "zh": "我们来看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 132.92,
      "end": 133.92,
      "en": "$625 US dollars.",
      "zh": "625美元。"
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 133.92,
      "end": 145.2,
      "en": "That's more than my round-trip ticket!",
      "zh": "这都比我的往返机票还贵！"
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 145.2,
      "end": 147.62,
      "en": "All right, well, that's a whole lot of money, isn't it?",
      "zh": "好吧，那是一大笔钱，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 148.0,
      "end": 150.16,
      "en": "Well, I think it's a very common situation.",
      "zh": "嗯，我认为这是一个非常常见的情况。"
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 150.56,
      "end": 154.68,
      "en": "I'm sure many of our listeners can relate to this situation.",
      "zh": "我相信我们的许多听众都可以与这种情况联系起来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 154.68,
      "end": 156.72,
      "en": "Overweight charges are pretty expensive.",
      "zh": "超重费用相当昂贵。"
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 157.48,
      "end": 157.74,
      "en": "Very high.",
      "zh": "非常高。"
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "start": 158.48,
      "end": 159.24,
      "en": "I know from personal experience.",
      "zh": "我从个人经验中知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 160.0,
      "end": 161.34,
      "en": "But that's not what we want to talk about now.",
      "zh": "但这不是我们现在想谈的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "start": 161.5,
      "end": 165.56,
      "en": "We want to talk about some really useful vocabulary in Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "我们想在语言外卖中讨论一些非常有用的词汇。"
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "start": 168.28,
      "end": 168.66,
      "en": "Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "语言要点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "start": 169.28,
      "end": 173.96,
      "en": "All right, on Language Takeaway today, we have five words.",
      "zh": "好吧，关于今天的语言外卖，我们有五个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "start": 173.96,
      "end": 175.3,
      "en": "So why don't we start with the first one?",
      "zh": "那么我们为什么不从第一个开始呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "start": 175.88,
      "end": 179.28,
      "en": "So the woman asked, will you be checking any bags today?",
      "zh": "所以女人问，你今天会检查任何行李吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "start": 180.0,
      "end": 182.34,
      "en": "Will you be checking any bags today?",
      "zh": "您今天有行李要托运吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "start": 182.68,
      "end": 183.94,
      "en": "To check bags.",
      "zh": "检查行李。"
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "start": 184.0,
      "end": 185.0,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "start": 185.0,
      "end": 186.1,
      "en": "So the verb to check.",
      "zh": "所以动词要检查。"
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "start": 186.84,
      "end": 192.25,
      "en": "It means to give your bags to the airline, to register them.",
      "zh": "这意味着将您的行李交给航空公司，进行注册。"
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "start": 192.72,
      "end": 194.89,
      "en": "Okay, so that's what happens with your luggage.",
      "zh": "好的，这就是你的行李发生的事情。"
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "start": 195.28,
      "end": 198.65,
      "en": "You check them, so basically they become responsible for your bags.",
      "zh": "你检查它们，所以基本上它们对你的包负责。"
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "start": 198.96,
      "end": 199.96,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "start": 199.96,
      "end": 202.68,
      "en": "It reminds me of checking in to a hotel.",
      "zh": "它让我想起了入住酒店。"
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "start": 202.73,
      "end": 203.63,
      "en": "Right, very similar.",
      "zh": "对，非常相似。"
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "start": 203.83,
      "end": 206.29,
      "en": "When you go to a hotel, you register at the hotel.",
      "zh": "当你去酒店时，你在酒店注册。"
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "start": 206.53,
      "end": 207.33,
      "en": "You check in.",
      "zh": "你入住。"
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "start": 207.85,
      "end": 210.29,
      "en": "In this case, you just check your luggage.",
      "zh": "在这种情况下，您只需检查您的行李。"
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "start": 210.48,
      "end": 211.64,
      "en": "You don't check in your luggage.",
      "zh": "你不托运行李。"
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "start": 211.67,
      "end": 211.81,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "start": 212.19,
      "end": 213.57,
      "en": "Okay, so check luggage.",
      "zh": "好的，所以托运行李。"
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "start": 214.4,
      "end": 219.66,
      "en": "So he wanted to check three pieces of luggage, and he also had carry-on luggage.",
      "zh": "所以他想检查三件行李，还带着随身行李。"
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "start": 220.4,
      "end": 221.84,
      "en": "Carry-on luggage.",
      "zh": "随身行李。"
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "start": 221.84,
      "end": 223.2,
      "en": "Carry-on.",
      "zh": "随身携带。"
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "start": 223.2,
      "end": 225.19,
      "en": "So carry-on luggage, it's pretty simple.",
      "zh": "所以随身携带的行李，很简单。"
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "start": 225.6,
      "end": 227.31,
      "en": "That's right, you carry it on yourself.",
      "zh": "没错，你自己承担。"
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "start": 227.68,
      "end": 229.89,
      "en": "Exactly, you carry it on to the plane.",
      "zh": "没错，你把它带到飞机上。"
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "start": 230.32,
      "end": 233.15,
      "en": "Now we can talk about carry-on luggage, right?",
      "zh": "现在我们可以谈谈随身行李，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "start": 234.2,
      "end": 235.68,
      "en": "Or carry-on bag.",
      "zh": "或随身携带的包。"
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "start": 235.68,
      "end": 237.96,
      "en": "Right, or a carry-on suitcase.",
      "zh": "对，或随身携带的手提箱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "start": 237.96,
      "end": 240.64,
      "en": "A very small suitcase that can fit under your seat.",
      "zh": "一个非常小的手提箱，可以放在您的座位下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "start": 240.64,
      "end": 241.64,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "start": 241.64,
      "end": 243.56,
      "en": "All right, so carry-on luggage.",
      "zh": "好吧，随身携带行李。"
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "start": 243.56,
      "end": 248.52,
      "en": "Now he was traveling on an intercontinental flight.",
      "zh": "现在他乘坐洲际航班旅行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "start": 248.52,
      "end": 249.05,
      "en": "Intercontinental.",
      "zh": "洲际。"
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "start": 249.99,
      "end": 250.63,
      "en": "Intercontinental.",
      "zh": "洲际。"
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "start": 251.6,
      "end": 252.75,
      "en": "We have two words there, inter.",
      "zh": "我们有两个词，国际米兰。"
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "start": 253.99,
      "end": 254.19,
      "en": "Between.",
      "zh": "之间。"
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "start": 254.6,
      "end": 254.73,
      "en": "Between, right?",
      "zh": "之间，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "start": 255.6,
      "end": 256.6,
      "en": "And continental.",
      "zh": "和大陆。"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "start": 256.6,
      "end": 257.85,
      "en": "So this sounds like continent.",
      "zh": "所以这听起来像大陆。"
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "start": 258.55,
      "end": 264.13,
      "en": "Okay, so he's traveling maybe from Asia to North America.",
      "zh": "好吧，所以他可能从亚洲到北美旅行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "start": 264.55,
      "end": 265.81,
      "en": "Okay, intercontinental.",
      "zh": "好吧，洲际。"
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "start": 266.53,
      "end": 269.37,
      "en": "He's trying to board this intercontinental flight.",
      "zh": "他正试图登上这次洲际飞行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "start": 269.93,
      "end": 272.07,
      "en": "So to board a flight.",
      "zh": "所以要登机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "start": 272.88,
      "end": 273.49,
      "en": "Board a plane.",
      "zh": "登机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "start": 274.4,
      "end": 274.81,
      "en": "Board a train.",
      "zh": "登上火车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "start": 275.4,
      "end": 277.6,
      "en": "All right, so basically it means to...",
      "zh": "好吧，所以基本上它的意思是..."
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "start": 277.6,
      "end": 278.01,
      "en": "To get on.",
      "zh": "上车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "start": 278.6,
      "end": 279.6,
      "en": "To get on.",
      "zh": "上车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
