      "id": 123,
      "start": 295.56,
      "end": 296.56,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "start": 296.56,
      "end": 297.56,
      "en": "In the train station, right?",
      "zh": "在火车站，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "start": 297.56,
      "end": 298.56,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "start": 298.56,
      "end": 299.56,
      "en": "All aboard.",
      "zh": "全部上船。"
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "start": 299.56,
      "end": 306.44,
      "en": "Okay, so board a vehicle and our last phrase for today, overhead compartment.",
      "zh": "好的，所以登上一辆车和我们今天的最后一句话，头顶隔间。"
    },
    {
      "id": 128,
      "start": 306.44,
      "end": 306.99,
      "en": "Overhead compartment.",
      "zh": "架空隔间。"
    },
    {
      "id": 129,
      "start": 308.48,
      "end": 308.73,
      "en": "Overhead compartment.",
      "zh": "架空隔间。"
    },
    {
      "id": 130,
      "start": 309.63,
      "end": 312.13,
      "en": "All right, let's break this phrase down.",
      "zh": "好吧，让我们分解这句话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 131,
      "start": 312.91,
      "end": 313.51,
      "en": "Overhead.",
      "zh": "开销。"
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "start": 314.15,
      "end": 316.37,
      "en": "So that's on top of your head, right?",
      "zh": "所以这在你的头顶，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "start": 316.55,
      "end": 316.75,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "start": 317.57,
      "end": 317.83,
      "en": "Above you.",
      "zh": "在你之上。"
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "start": 318.21,
      "end": 323.39,
      "en": "Yeah, and the compartment is a place where you can put something and store it.",
      "zh": "是的，隔间是你可以放东西和存放的地方。"
    },
    {
      "id": 136,
      "start": 323.98,
      "end": 324.64,
      "en": "Kind of like a box.",
      "zh": "有点像一个盒子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 137,
      "start": 325.1,
      "end": 325.32,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 138,
      "start": 326.12,
      "end": 327.12,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 139,
      "start": 327.12,
      "end": 332.38,
      "en": "So overhead compartment, that big box where you put your bags and your purse or whatever on an airplane.",
      "zh": "所以头顶隔间，你把包和钱包或任何东西放在飞机上的那个大盒子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 140,
      "start": 332.88,
      "end": 333.88,
      "en": "Mm-hmm.",
      "zh": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": 141,
      "start": 333.88,
      "end": 336.16,
      "en": "Very similar to, for example, an overhead projector.",
      "zh": "非常类似于，例如，投影仪。"
    },
    {
      "id": 142,
      "start": 336.5,
      "end": 341.72,
      "en": "Right, so that's the machine that puts an image or a picture on a wall, like sometimes you see them in meetings.",
      "zh": "是的，这就是将图像或图片放在墙上的机器，就像有时您在会议中看到它们一样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 143,
      "start": 342.22,
      "end": 346.32,
      "en": "Right, so because the image is over your head and it's big, it's called an overhead projector.",
      "zh": "对，所以因为图像在您的头上并且很大，因此称为投影仪。"
    },
    {
      "id": 144,
      "start": 346.71,
      "end": 348.69,
      "en": "Okay, so some great language.",
      "zh": "好吧，那么一些很棒的语言。"
    },
    {
      "id": 145,
      "start": 349.16,
      "end": 354.52,
      "en": "Why don't we hear it again in context by listening to the dialogue for the second time?",
      "zh": "为什么我们不通过第二次聆听对话在上下文中再次听到它？"
    },
    {
      "id": 146,
      "start": 359.91,
      "end": 360.93,
      "en": "Next, please.",
      "zh": "下一位，请。"
    },
    {
      "id": 147,
      "start": 361.77,
      "end": 362.77,
      "en": "Hello, sir.",
      "zh": "您好，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 148,
      "start": 363.45,
      "end": 365.31,
      "en": "May I see your passport, please?",
      "zh": "我可以看你的护照吗?"
    },
    {
      "id": 149,
      "start": 365.81,
      "end": 367.17,
      "en": "Yes, here you go.",
      "zh": "是的，给你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 150,
      "start": 367.78,
      "end": 370.36,
      "en": "Will you be checking any bags today?",
      "zh": "您今天有行李要托运吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 151,
      "start": 370.86,
      "end": 373.82,
      "en": "Yes, I'd like to check three pieces.",
      "zh": "是的，我想检查三块。"
    },
    {
      "id": 152,
      "start": 374.61,
      "end": 375.91,
      "en": "I'm sorry, sir.",
      "zh": "对不起，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 153,
      "start": 376.88,
      "end": 384.85,
      "en": "Airline policy allows only two pieces of checked luggage at 20 kilograms each, plus one piece of carry-on luggage.",
      "zh": "航空公司政策只允许两件托运行李，每件 20 公斤，外加一件随身行李。"
    },
    {
      "id": 154,
      "start": 385.72,
      "end": 389.06,
      "en": "I will have to charge you extra for the additional suitcase.",
      "zh": "第三件行李要额外收费。"
    },
    {
      "id": 155,
      "start": 389.88,
      "end": 390.14,
      "en": "What?",
      "zh": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 156,
      "start": 390.72,
      "end": 391.12,
      "en": "Why?",
      "zh": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 157,
      "start": 391.86,
      "end": 394.32,
      "en": "I'm taking an intercontinental flight.",
      "zh": "我坐的可是洲际航班。"
    },
    {
      "id": 158,
      "start": 395.08,
      "end": 398.28,
      "en": "I'm flying 16,000 kilometers.",
      "zh": "我要飞行一万六千公里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 159,
      "start": 398.28,
      "end": 401.48,
      "en": "How am I supposed to take only two 20-kilo bags?",
      "zh": "我应该怎么只拿两个 20 公斤的袋子？"
    },
    {
      "id": 160,
      "start": 402.16,
      "end": 402.28,
      "en": "That's absurd.",
      "zh": "太荒唐了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 161,
      "start": 403.16,
      "end": 404.3,
      "en": "I'm sorry, sir.",
      "zh": "对不起，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 162,
      "start": 404.76,
      "end": 406.24,
      "en": "There's nothing I can do.",
      "zh": "我也无能为力。"
    },
    {
      "id": 163,
      "start": 406.82,
      "end": 409.7,
      "en": "You cannot board the flight with that large bag either.",
      "zh": "那个大包也不能带上飞机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 164,
      "start": 410.96,
      "end": 416.08,
      "en": "Carry-on bags must fit in the overhead compartment or under your seat.",
      "zh": "随身行李必须放得进头顶行李舱或前排座椅下方。"
    },
    {
      "id": 165,
      "start": 416.08,
      "end": 417.89,
      "en": "That bag is clearly too big.",
      "zh": "那个包显然太大了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 166,
      "start": 418.68,
      "end": 419.21,
      "en": "Now I see.",
      "zh": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 167,
      "start": 420.2,
      "end": 423.83,
      "en": "You charge next to nothing for an international ticket.",
      "zh": "国际机票几乎不收取任何费用。"
    },
    {
      "id": 168,
      "start": 424.86,
      "end": 430.15,
      "en": "But when it comes to charging for any other small thing, you charge an arm and a leg.",
      "zh": "但是，当涉及到任何其他小事充电时，您会为手臂和腿充电。"
    },
    {
      "id": 169,
      "start": 431.08,
      "end": 434.69,
      "en": "So tell me, miss, how much will I have to pay for all this?",
      "zh": "所以告诉我，小姐，我要为这一切付出多少？"
    },
    {
      "id": 170,
      "start": 435.71,
      "end": 436.51,
      "en": "Let's see.",
      "zh": "我们来看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 171,
      "start": 437.2,
      "end": 438.2,
      "en": "$625 US dollars.",
      "zh": "625美元。"
    },
    {
      "id": 172,
      "start": 438.2,
      "end": 439.2,
      "en": "No.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 173,
      "start": 441.24,
      "end": 443.2,
      "en": "That's more than my round-trip ticket.",
      "zh": "这不仅仅是我的往返票。"
    },
    {
      "id": 174,
      "start": 443.44,
      "end": 445.36,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 175,
      "start": 448.34,
      "end": 450.4,
      "en": "So I think it's a little bit more clear now.",
      "zh": "所以我认为现在更清楚一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 176,
      "start": 450.98,
      "end": 455.96,
      "en": "And with this, it's time for us to take a look at some great phrases in putting it together.",
      "zh": "有了这个，是时候让我们看看把它放在一起的一些很棒的短语了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 177,
      "start": 457.8,
      "end": 458.94,
      "en": "Putting it together.",
      "zh": "综合运用。"
    },
    {
      "id": 178,
      "start": 460.27,
      "end": 464.75,
      "en": "So this guy was pretty angry about this airline policy.",
      "zh": "所以这家伙对这个航空公司的政策很生气。"
    },
    {
      "id": 179,
      "start": 464.75,
      "end": 468.07,
      "en": "And he said, how am I supposed to?",
      "zh": "他说，我该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "id": 180,
      "start": 468.79,
      "end": 470.59,
      "en": "How am I supposed to?",
      "zh": "我应该怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "id": 181,
      "start": 470.87,
      "end": 471.95,
      "en": "How am I supposed to?",
      "zh": "我应该怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "id": 182,
      "start": 472.33,
      "end": 472.57,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 183,
      "start": 472.73,
      "end": 479.59,
      "en": "So before we get into explaining this, why don't we listen to a couple of examples so we can try and understand what it means.",
      "zh": "因此，在我们开始解释之前，我们为什么不听几个例子，以便我们可以尝试理解它的含义。"
    },
    {
      "id": 184,
      "start": 481.64,
      "end": 481.94,
      "en": "Example one.",
      "zh": "例句一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 185,
      "start": 484.84,
      "end": 486.46,
      "en": "How am I supposed to fit the dog in the car?",
      "zh": "我应该如何将狗放入车内？"
    },
    {
      "id": 186,
      "start": 486.88,
      "end": 491.08,
      "en": "There are 10 people in there already.",
      "zh": "里面已经有10人了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 187,
      "start": 491.08,
      "end": 491.34,
      "en": "Example two.",
      "zh": "例句二。"
    },
    {
      "id": 188,
      "start": 494.32,
      "end": 496.19,
      "en": "How is she supposed to get to work if her car's in the shop?",
      "zh": "如果她的车在商店里，她应该怎么去上班？"
    },
    {
      "id": 189,
      "start": 500.04,
      "end": 501.04,
      "en": "Example three.",
      "zh": "例句三。"
    },
    {
      "id": 190,
      "start": 503.0,
      "end": 505.1,
      "en": "How are we supposed to know the answer to that?",
      "zh": "我们应该如何知道答案？"
    },
    {
      "id": 191,
      "start": 505.48,
      "end": 506.0,
      "en": "It's impossible.",
      "zh": "这是不可能的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 192,
      "start": 508.18,
      "end": 508.62,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 193,
      "start": 508.8,
      "end": 512.56,
      "en": "So I can understand that it means, how can I do this?",
      "zh": "所以我可以理解这意味着，我该怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "id": 194,
      "start": 513.12,
      "end": 514.12,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 195,
      "start": 514.12,
      "end": 515.1,
      "en": "How do you expect me to do this?",
      "zh": "你希望我怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "id": 196,
      "start": 515.36,
      "end": 517.04,
      "en": "How is it possible for me to do this?",
      "zh": "我怎么可能做到这一点？"
    },
    {
      "id": 197,
      "start": 517.64,
      "end": 517.84,
      "en": "Very good.",
      "zh": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 198,
      "start": 518.64,
      "end": 520.28,
      "en": "It's a phrase you use when you're frustrated, right?",
      "zh": "这是你在沮丧时使用的短语，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 199,
      "start": 520.68,
      "end": 521.08,
      "en": "Yeah, exactly.",
      "zh": "对，没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 200,
      "start": 521.68,
      "end": 527.2,
      "en": "When you're maybe a little bit frustrated or you're maybe nervous of something that you can't do or don't know how.",
      "zh": "当您可能有点沮丧或您可能对自己做不到或不知道如何做的事情感到紧张时。"
    },
    {
      "id": 201,
      "start": 527.2,
      "end": 528.2,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 202,
      "start": 528.2,
      "end": 533.82,
      "en": "This phrase, it's not impolite, but it sort of gives the idea that you're challenging the other person a little bit.",
      "zh": "这句话，它不是不礼貌的，但它有点让你有点挑战对方的想法。"
    },
    {
      "id": 203,
      "start": 534.36,
      "end": 535.36,
      "en": "Maybe.",
      "zh": "也许吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 204,
      "start": 535.36,
      "end": 536.36,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 205,
      "start": 536.36,
      "end": 537.36,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 206,
      "start": 537.36,
      "end": 542.24,
      "en": "So a good phrase that you can use in different situations and you can try and mix it up with different verbs, right?",
      "zh": "所以一个好短语，你可以在不同的情况下使用，你可以尝试将它与不同的动词混合，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 207,
      "start": 542.24,
      "end": 543.24,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 208,
      "start": 543.24,
      "end": 544.24,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 209,
      "start": 544.24,
      "end": 544.85,
      "en": "Now let's take a look at our next phrase.",
      "zh": "现在让我们来看看我们的下一个短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 210,
      "start": 546.04,
      "end": 546.8,
      "en": "I'm sorry, sir.",
      "zh": "对不起，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 211,
      "start": 547.44,
      "end": 548.62,
      "en": "There's nothing I can do.",
      "zh": "我也无能为力。"
    },
    {
      "id": 212,
      "start": 549.24,
      "end": 550.38,
      "en": "There's nothing I can do.",
      "zh": "我也无能为力。"
    },
    {
      "id": 213,
      "start": 551.16,
      "end": 552.42,
      "en": "There's nothing I can do.",
      "zh": "我也无能为力。"
    },
    {
      "id": 214,
      "start": 552.68,
      "end": 553.38,
      "en": "There's nothing I can do.",
      "zh": "我也无能为力。"
    },
    {
      "id": 215,
      "start": 553.8,
      "end": 560.5,
      "en": "So basically, the woman can't help the man, even though he's insisting and he's pushing that he wants another solution.",
      "zh": "所以基本上，女人不能帮助这个男人，即使他坚持并且他在推动他想要另一个解决方案。"
    },
    {
      "id": 216,
      "start": 560.76,
      "end": 561.76,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 217,
      "start": 561.76,
      "end": 562.76,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 218,
      "start": 562.76,
      "end": 566.34,
      "en": "So finally, she says, I'm sorry, there's nothing I can do.",
      "zh": "所以最后，她说，对不起，我无能为力。"
    },
    {
      "id": 219,
      "start": 566.34,
      "end": 570.54,
      "en": "So we use this phrase when someone's pushing you too much, right?",
      "zh": "所以当有人推你太多时，我们使用这个短语，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 220,
      "start": 570.84,
      "end": 571.02,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 221,
      "start": 571.14,
      "end": 575.46,
      "en": "And you would use it only in that situation towards the end because it is a little bit...",
      "zh": "你只会在最后的情况下使用它，因为它有点..."
    },
    {
      "id": 222,
      "start": 575.46,
      "end": 576.14,
      "en": "It's strong.",
      "zh": "挺强烈的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 223,
      "start": 576.92,
      "end": 581.74,
      "en": "It's not in plight, but it's just, you're saying, you know what, I'm sorry, there's I can't do anything about it.",
      "zh": "这不是陷入困境，但它只是，你在说，你知道什么，对不起，我对此无能为力。"
    },
    {
      "id": 224,
      "start": 581.96,
      "end": 584.0,
      "en": "Now let's move on to our third phrase.",
      "zh": "现在让我们继续我们的第三个短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 225,
      "start": 585.16,
      "end": 588.16,
      "en": "You charge next to nothing.",
      "zh": "你几乎没有收费。"
    },
    {
      "id": 226,
      "start": 588.16,
      "end": 588.6,
      "en": "Next to nothing.",
      "zh": "几乎没有。"
    },
    {
      "id": 227,
      "start": 589.84,
      "end": 590.62,
      "en": "Next to nothing.",
      "zh": "几乎没有。"
    },
    {
      "id": 228,
      "start": 591.0,
      "end": 592.0,
      "en": "Next to nothing.",
      "zh": "几乎没有。"
    },
    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 592.0,
      "end": 593.0,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 593.0,
      "end": 593.47,
      "en": "So we're talking about charging.",
      "zh": "所以我们在谈论充电。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 594.0,
      "end": 595.92,
      "en": "We're talking about money.",
      "zh": "我们在谈论金钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 595.92,
      "end": 602.24,
      "en": "Why don't we listen to some examples of what this next to nothing phrase means?",
      "zh": "为什么我们不听一些关于这句话几乎没有意义的例子？"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 602.24,
      "end": 602.59,
      "en": "Example one.",
      "zh": "例句一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 606.28,
      "end": 607.0,
      "en": "Do you like my new house?",
      "zh": "你喜欢我的新房子吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 607.44,
      "end": 609.34,
      "en": "It was so cheap that it almost cost next to nothing.",
      "zh": "它是如此便宜，几乎没有任何东西。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 613.28,
      "end": 614.28,
      "en": "Example two.",
      "zh": "例句二。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 614.28,
      "end": 618.88,
      "en": "Let's go to Thailand.",
      "zh": "我们去泰国吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 618.88,
      "end": 620.11,
      "en": "Tickets cost next to nothing right now.",
      "zh": "门票现在几乎没有任何费用。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 624.56,
      "end": 624.95,
      "en": "Example three.",
      "zh": "例句三。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 628.12,
      "end": 632.08,
      "en": "The real estate agent charged me next to nothing for his commission, so I got a really good deal.",
      "zh": "房地产经纪人几乎没有向我收取佣金，所以我得到了一个非常好的交易。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 634.03,
      "end": 637.37,
      "en": "So when something costs next to nothing, it's really cheap, right?",
      "zh": "因此，当某些东西几乎没有成本时，它真的很便宜，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 637.37,
      "end": 639.43,
      "en": "It's really cheap, or you consider it to be cheap.",
      "zh": "它真的很便宜，或者你认为它很便宜。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 640.25,
      "end": 644.01,
      "en": "And now for our last phrase, it's the complete opposite of next to nothing.",
      "zh": "现在对于我们的最后一句话，它完全相反。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 644.8,
      "end": 645.8,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 645.8,
      "end": 646.83,
      "en": "Charge an arm and a leg.",
      "zh": "充电一条胳膊和一条腿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 647.6,
      "end": 648.81,
      "en": "An arm and a leg.",
      "zh": "一条胳膊和一条腿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 649.08,
      "end": 650.09,
      "en": "An arm and a leg.",
      "zh": "一条胳膊和一条腿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 650.51,
      "end": 651.03,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 651.48,
      "end": 653.23,
      "en": "So this means it's really expensive.",
      "zh": "所以这意味着它真的很贵。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 653.8,
      "end": 654.47,
      "en": "It's so expensive.",
      "zh": "它太贵了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 654.88,
      "end": 656.81,
      "en": "It's like giving your arm and your leg.",
      "zh": "这就像给你的手臂和腿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 657.21,
      "end": 657.41,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 657.53,
      "end": 658.15,
      "en": "To pay for it.",
      "zh": "为此付出代价。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 659.16,
      "end": 660.16,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 660.16,
      "end": 661.16,
      "en": "Very good.",
      "zh": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 661.16,
      "end": 662.16,
      "en": "So next to nothing, really cheap.",
      "zh": "所以几乎没有，真的很便宜。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 662.16,
      "end": 664.19,
      "en": "An arm and a leg, really expensive.",
      "zh": "一条胳膊和一条腿，真的很贵。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 664.92,
      "end": 665.75,
      "en": "Can we look at the use here?",
      "zh": "我们可以看看这里的用途吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 666.27,
      "end": 666.85,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 666.95,
      "end": 673.45,
      "en": "So in the dialogue we heard, you charge an arm and a leg, but we can also say it costs an arm and a leg.",
      "zh": "所以在我们听到的对话中，你充电一条胳膊和一条腿，但我们也可以说它需要一条胳膊和一条腿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 673.77,
      "end": 673.93,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 673.99,
      "end": 675.67,
      "en": "Because we are referring to money.",
      "zh": "因为我们指的是金钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 676.27,
      "end": 676.39,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 676.8,
      "end": 676.97,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 677.8,
      "end": 678.15,
      "en": "So some great phrases here.",
      "zh": "所以这里有一些很棒的短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 678.8,
      "end": 681.57,
      "en": "Now I think it's time we listen to our dialogue one more time.",
      "zh": "现在我想是时候再听一次我们的对话了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 690.88,
      "end": 693.12,
      "en": "What?",
      "zh": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 693.12,
      "end": 695.12,
      "en": "Why?",
      "zh": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 713.45,
      "end": 715.01,
      "en": "I'm taking an intercontinental flight.",
      "zh": "我坐的可是洲际航班。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 715.36,
      "end": 717.72,
      "en": "I'm flying 16,000 kilometers.",
      "zh": "我要飞行一万六千公里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 717.72,
      "end": 720.92,
      "en": "How am I supposed to take only two 20 kilo bags?",
      "zh": "只带两件二十公斤的行李怎么够？"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 720.92,
      "end": 721.09,
      "en": "That's absurd.",
      "zh": "太荒唐了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 721.92,
      "end": 722.89,
      "en": "I'm sorry, sir.",
      "zh": "对不起，先生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 723.2,
      "end": 723.91,
      "en": "There's nothing I can do.",
      "zh": "我也无能为力。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 724.66,
      "end": 727.17,
      "en": "You cannot board the flight with that large bag either.",
      "zh": "那个大包也不能带上飞机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 727.68,
      "end": 731.84,
      "en": "Carry-on bags must fit in the overhead compartment or under your seat.",
      "zh": "随身行李必须放得进头顶行李舱或前排座椅下方。"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 731.84,
      "end": 733.51,
      "en": "That bag is clearly too big.",
      "zh": "那个包显然太大了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 734.16,
      "end": 734.45,
      "en": "Now I see.",
      "zh": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 735.16,
      "end": 736.85,
      "en": "You charge next to nothing for an international ticket.",
      "zh": "国际机票几乎不收取任何费用。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 737.52,
      "end": 740.63,
      "en": "When it comes to charging for any other small thing, you charge an arm and a leg.",
      "zh": "其他一点小事却收费贵得离谱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 741.23,
      "end": 744.05,
      "en": "So tell me, miss, how much will I have to pay for all of this?",
      "zh": "小姐，你说吧，这些一共要付多少钱？"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 745.01,
      "end": 745.87,
      "en": "Let's see.",
      "zh": "我们来看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 746.32,
      "end": 747.84,
      "en": "625 US dollars.",
      "zh": "625美元。"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 749.36,
      "end": 750.82,
      "en": "That's more than my round trip ticket.",
      "zh": "这不仅仅是我的往返票。"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 753.23,
      "end": 753.71,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 753.75,
      "end": 757.35,
      "en": "So airline policies, luggage, it's always a problem, right?",
      "zh": "所以航空公司的政策，行李，这总是一个问题，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 757.73,
      "end": 760.85,
      "en": "Most of the time you always end up paying overweight when you travel.",
      "zh": "大多数时候，你总是在旅行时付出超重的代价。"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 761.27,
      "end": 761.43,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 761.65,
      "end": 766.33,
      "en": "I know that this happened to me once and it was really expensive.",
      "zh": "我知道这发生在我身上一次，而且真的很贵。"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 767.01,
      "end": 767.25,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 291,
      "start": 767.6,
      "end": 768.6,
      "en": "What happened?",
      "zh": "发生什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 768.6,
      "end": 776.27,
      "en": "I was flying on an intercontinental flight from India back to Europe and I had too many extra bags, but I really needed to bring them.",
      "zh": "我乘坐洲际航班从印度飞回欧洲，我有太多额外的行李，但我真的需要带上它们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 293,
      "start": 776.44,
      "end": 778.44,
      "en": "And so it cost me $6,000.",
      "zh": "所以它花了我 6,000 美元。"
    },
    {
      "id": 294,
      "start": 778.44,
      "end": 779.44,
      "en": "$6,000.",
      "zh": "6,000 美元。"
    },
    {
      "id": 295,
      "start": 779.44,
      "end": 780.44,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 296,
      "start": 780.44,
      "end": 781.44,
      "en": "Wow.",
      "zh": "哇。"
    },
    {
      "id": 297,
      "start": 781.81,
      "end": 785.09,
      "en": "So my credit card was pretty maxed out after that.",
      "zh": "所以在那之后我的信用卡已经用完了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 298,
      "start": 786.12,
      "end": 786.51,
      "en": "That's incredible.",
      "zh": "这太不可思议了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 299,
      "start": 787.12,
      "end": 788.12,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "start": 788.12,
      "end": 791.89,
      "en": "Well, I'm sure many of our users probably suffered similar experiences like this.",
      "zh": "好吧，我敢肯定我们的许多用户可能遭受了类似的经历。"
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "start": 792.04,
      "end": 796.28,
      "en": "So please come to our website and share it with us at EnglishPod.com.",
      "zh": "因此，请访问我们的网站并在 Englishpod.com 上与我们分享。"
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "start": 796.28,
      "end": 796.45,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "start": 797.28,
      "end": 798.95,
      "en": "Marco and I are always around to answer your questions.",
      "zh": "马可和我总是在身边回答你的问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 304,
      "start": 799.37,
      "end": 802.27,
      "en": "So please check us out and thanks for downloading you guys.",
      "zh": "所以请查看我们，感谢您下载你们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 305,
      "start": 802.76,
      "end": 803.31,
      "en": "Until next time.",
      "zh": "下次再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 306,
      "start": 803.76,
      "end": 804.26,
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
  ],
